<<ProfileLog $mom "The Booze Night" "She opened a bottle of wine on a weeknight and talked about $dad.callName, and about how nobody has picked her for anything in years. I listened and didn't touch her. She went upstairs on her own, and I heard her bed through the ceiling.">>
<<ProfileMemory $mom "Picked" "She told me $dad.callName walked across a whole party to find her in the kitchen. She still has the dress from her cousin's wedding. She's almost sure it still fits.">>
